sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as transfer-service
    participant A as account-service
    participant S as step_record

    T->>A: EXECUTE DEBIT_SOURCE, attempt 1
    A->>S: no row, debit Alice, insert APPLIED
    A--xT: reply lost (fault LOSE_REPLY)
    Note over T,A: deadline passes (3 s), timeout scan
    T->>A: EXECUTE DEBIT_SOURCE, attempt 2
    A->>S: row APPLIED found, no second debit
    A-->>T: DONE, duplicate = true
    T->>T: step SUCCEEDED, send CREDIT_DESTINATION
